<Page title="Terms and conditions" description="Hire and purchase terms and conditions for Max Healthcare Equipment." crumbs={[{ label: 'Terms and conditions' }]}
  lede="Please read these terms before hiring or buying equipment.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="muted">TODO: carried across from the current site. Max to review and approve the full wording before launch.</p>
    <h2>Hire equipment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Hire equipment remains the property of Max Healthcare Equipment.</li>
      <li>Hire is charged at a weekly rate. An additional week is charged if the hire has reached the majority of a week (4 days or more).</li>
      <li>If hire equipment is returned before the end of time paid in advance, we can only refund full weeks, not part weeks.</li>
      <li>Equipment must be returned clean and in good working order. Equipment returned in an unsatisfactory condition may attract cleaning fees, and we may refuse unsanitary or unclean items. Charges may be added to the customer's account if necessary.</li>
      <li>The customer is responsible for telling us when they want to arrange collection or return of hire items. Failure to contact us may result in hire items being charged as purchase items.</li>
      <li>A delivery or collection fee applies each time we perform this service at the customer's request.</li>
      <li>We may store and use credit or debit card details if an unpaid debt has occurred.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not buy back stock in any situation.</li>
      <li>Ex-hire equipment that is purchased cannot be returned, refunded or exchanged and does not come with a warranty.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>See also <a href="/returns-refunds/">returns and refunds</a> and our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Page>
